</pre>

To display the active key given the client key ID:

<pre>
$ pki -d ~/.dogtag/pki-tomcat/ca/alias -c Secret.123 -n caadmin kra-key-show --clientKeyID test
  Key ID: 0x1
  Client Key ID: test
  Status: active
  Algorithm: RSA
  Size: 1024
  Owner: kraadmin
  Public Key: 

MIGfMA0GCSqGSIb3DQEBAQUAA4GNADCBiQKBgQC08pXsqW0hkZ2/Pj/wSLQO+Jk3
